  "id": "organicism",
  "term": "organicism",
  "definition": "Organicism is a way of understanding development that treats the organism as the central unit of explanation and emphasizes its ongoing, mutual relation with the environment. In this view, development is understood through organism–environment interdependence rather than by looking at the organism or surroundings separately.",
